{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 18, "model_name": "qwen/qwen3.5-397b-a17b", "content": "Arthur woke to the familiar chirp of his alarm, but something felt distinctly off about the way the sunlight filtered through his bedroom window; it was too perfect, lacking the subtle dust motes he usually saw dancing in the morning air. As he stumbled to the bathroom, he noticed a faint, green bar hovering just above his reflection in the mirror, pulsing gently with a label that read \"Stamina: 98%.\" Panic surged through him as he reached out to touch the glass, only for his hand to pass slightly through the surface before snapping back with a rigid, programmed resistance, and when he tried to speak, a dialogue box appeared in his peripheral vision offering three distinct responses to his own confusion.\n\n***\n\nThe reality of his situation crystallized when he stepped outside and saw the neighborhood rendered in high-definition textures that shimmered unnaturally at the edges of his vision, while pedestrians walked in looping patterns with identical gait cycles. He watched in horror as a neighbor dropped a coffee cup, which didn't shatter but instead clipped through the pavement and vanished, accompanied by a soft, digital chime that signaled an item loss. Accepting his new existence, Arthur took a deep breath, focused on the strange menu only he could see, and selected the \"Quest Log\" option, realizing that his only way forward was to play along with the narrative the game had written for him.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Arthur", "logprob": -0.001614562}, {"token": " woke", "logprob": -0.0015472216}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.0011367103}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " familiar", "logprob": -0.0009446432}, {"token": " chir", "logprob": -0.030025879}, {"token": "p", "logprob": -0.6931472}, {"token": " of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " his", "logprob": -5.960466e-07}, {"token": " alarm", "logprob": -0.003936758}, {"token": ",", "l